-- HARES ON THE ROAD (rome, 2026-11-13). The road had sixteen animals to eat and
-- twenty-two hunters, and the goats, deer and otters were going under it. Its own
-- words already name the answer: the Hare Ground is "full of forms", the Spoil Banks
-- have been dug by rabbits. The mountain hare is put on the road's grass, where it
-- breeds fast and every dog, the bear and the adders can take one alone; it roams
-- the road as the road's other animals do (living-regions.md). No new animal.
